# Build context for infrastructure/images/spa/Dockerfile (ADR-FE-014): the
# image compiles from source, so local installs and build output stay out, and
# .env files never reach a layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/storybook-static
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.cache
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
docs
